ook  um you know in in sussex we've had 1  million people vaccinated so i'm just  really pleased that the vaccination  program is going incredibly well  and we're getting towards the end of um  this covered  lockdown and we'll be out of it by the  end of june yeah you can meet up with  five other people outside from tomorrow  it will be incredible very exciting news  right garnier thank you very much for  being on the program today thank you  thank you  well that is it for the main show busy  one lots of different covers  topics covered on the show after the  break we're going to be going over all  of the main things we learned  getting some analysis with our political  correspondent rob powell that's on  sophie ridge the take  straight after this break so don't go  anywhere  [Music]  you
 

